 "caption": "Flat high? It isn't RESISTANCE. ⚠️\n\nTwo tops at the exact same price look like a wall of sellers. On the profile it's the opposite: a poor high, no excess, no tail, no aggressive selling. The auction up there is unfinished, and the market usually comes back to finish it, running the stops of everyone who shorted the \"double top\".\n\n1️⃣ Flat high with no excess = unfinished auction\n2️⃣ Don't short a poor high just because it held twice\n3️⃣ Expect price to come back and trade above it\n\nFollow @institutionalmetatrading for daily order flow and SMC rules.\n\nEducational content. Not financial advice.\n\n#marketprofile #orderflow #auctiontheory #volumeprofile #daytrading #futurestrading #smartmoneyconcepts #tradingtips"
